  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Amazon Web Services -- leveraging DynamoDB (key-value/document) and S3 (object storage) for OASIS holon and avatar persistence at global AWS scale. Ideal for existing AWS-hosted applications adding OASIS capabilities with enterprise SLAs. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
